3. Used React.lazy and Suspense for the component import to handle loading states gracefully

4. Removed unnecessary mock components and imports that weren't being used

5. Structured the providers in the same order as shown in the stack trace

6. Added error handling through Suspense and the catch clause in the lazy loading

